I built an OFAC Sanctions Enforcement Dashboard in Power BI using live US Treasury data.
Key findings from 18,864 sanctioned entries:
🔹 Russia EO14024 is now the largest sanctions program — bigger than Iran, North Korea, and Global Terrorism combined
🔹 50.96% of entries are aliases — this is exactly why name-matching generates false positives in daily screening
🔹 7.81% are vessels — the shadow fleet sanctions evasion problem, visualised
